<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>生效范围</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>本插件只在 CarPlay（无线或有线）音频环境下生效；扬声器、普通蓝牙、耳机下完全不影响系统。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yourname.carplaylatencykiller</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>applyToAll</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>应用到所有 App</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yourname.carplaylatencykiller</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>whitelist</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>白名单 App（Bundle ID）</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>如 com.ss.iphone.ugc.Ame, com.tencent.xin</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>逗号分隔。抖音：com.ss.iphone.ugc.Ame。开启“应用到所有 App”时可不填。修改后请重新打开一次对应 App 生效。</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>预热（推荐开启）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>提前激活音频会话并预建立 CarPlay 音频流，消除“首次出声慢 / 2-3 秒才响”。对绝大多数 App 无害。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yourname.carplaylatencykiller</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enablePrewarm</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用预热</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>低延迟路径（实验，默认关）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>把音频会话切到 voicePrompt 等低延迟协商路径，可把持续延迟从 ~1.1s 压到几百 ms。⚠️ 可能有副作用（单声道、录音通道、App 行为异常），需在你的车型上实机试；异常请关闭。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yourname.carplaylatencykiller</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enableLowLatency</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用低延迟路径</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>CarPlay Latency Killer</string>
</dict>
</plist>
